Being *hit* by a poisoned needle trap is pretty rare, although having
the needle miss is quite common.  If your luck is non-negative, then
only 1/130 of chest traps that you set off will be poisoned needle
traps (tower of flame, surge of electricity, paralysis and gas cloud
are much more common).
